      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Viking Gas Transmission Company's System Map may be viewed and downloaded on its electronic bulletin board web site, http://dtmidstream.trellisenergy.com/ptms/home/infopost/VGT, by selecting "Informational Postings" then "Maps".</span>
