                <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Repayments - On December 31, 2024, we repaid the full $60 million of the term loan due March 2026 with $129,912 remaining in account 181 related to the term loan. That amount was reclassified to account 189, Unamortized Loss on Reacquired Debt, and will be amortized through March 2026 to account 428.1, Amortization of Loss on Reacquired Debt. $112,719 of debt expense was amortized to account 428, Amortization of Debt Discounts and Expenses, during 2024, and $108,563 was an adjustment between accrued debt issuance expenses and actual incurred expenses.</span>
