    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-32" id="fn-32" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">In July 2023, Viking filed with the FERC in Docket No. RP23-917-000 a proposed increase in rates pursuant to Section 4 of the Natural Gas Act of 1938. In February 2024, the participants reached a settlement in principle and in an update to Part 5, Statement of Rates under Docket No. RP23-917-005, the FERC Chief Administrative Law Judge approved placing the rates from the settlement in principle in effect February 1, 2024, on an interim basis. Viking&#8217;s settlement agreement was filed with the FERC in April 2024 and was approved by the FERC July 2024. The amortization period for the deferred rate case expenses began upon FERC approval of the settlement in July 2024, and will be over a period of 36 months.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
